    <labels>
        <fullName>Contact_Preferences_Help_Text</fullName>
        <language>en_US</language>
        <protected>false</protected>
        <shortDescription>Contact Preferences Help Text</shortDescription>
        <value>Below you can manage your email preferences.  &quot;Email Alerts&quot; checked means you&apos;ll receive an email each time we publish a piece of content on the corresponding topic/title.  &quot;Include in Daily Summary&quot; checked means you&apos;ll receive this topic in your once-per-day email summary of content published in the previous 24 hours.  If you see &quot;N/A&quot; instead of a check-box, it means that topic/title is not entitled to your account.
Please allow two hours for changes to register across our systems.</value>
    </labels>
